> p(x: u8, n: u8) = x << n
> domain p
domain of p:
  x: u8, 0..255
  n: u8, 0..255
  requires 0 <= n < 8  (shift amount; C UB otherwise)
  defined at 2048 of 65536 points
  undefined e.g. at x=0, n=8; x=1, n=8; x=2, n=8; x=3, n=8
  C undefined behaviour at 63488 points, e.g. x=0, n=8
  over all 65536 points of the domain
> q(x: u8) = x << 8
> domain q
domain of q:
  x: u8, 0..255
  no conditions: total on its parameter types
  defined at 0 of 256 points
  undefined e.g. at x=0; x=1; x=2; x=3
  C undefined behaviour at 256 points, e.g. x=0
  over all 256 points of the domain
> r(x: u16) = x >> 16
> domain r
domain of r:
  x: u16, 0..65535
  no conditions: total on its parameter types
  defined at 0 of 65536 points
  undefined e.g. at x=0; x=1; x=2; x=3
  C undefined behaviour at 65536 points, e.g. x=0
  over all 65536 points of the domain
> t(i: u8 in 0..7) = [3, 1, 4, 1, 5, 9, 2, 6][i]
> domain t
domain of t:
  i: u8, 0..7
  requires 0 <= i < 8  (table index)
  defined at 8 of 8 points
  over all 8 points of the domain
